 move beyond the repetition of subjective information to employ relevant technical terms.\n[RESULT] A\n\n**Evidence-Based Support:**\n- **Response A** aligns with medical details and recommendations such as ordering an MRI, prescribing medications, and advising on activity restrictions as per the notes, showing support for the plan based on evidence from the exam and patient report.\n- **Response B** does not reach a point where evidence-based plans or assessments are discussed due to its repetitive nature and lack of coverage.\n[RESULT] A\n\nThe better response is **Response A**.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1734048041, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_cc5cf1c6e3", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 447, "prompt_tokens": 6566, "total_tokens": 7013, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}}


