essure?\n[patient] it was really high.\n[doctor] okay. so, they were able to get it under control?\n[patient] yeah, they did.\n[doctor] okay. and what about your ankles? you said your ankles were swollen?\n[patient] yeah, they were swollen.\n[doctor] okay. and was that because of the heart problem or was it something else?\n[patient] i\'m not sure.\n[doctor] okay. so, they did some tests and they said that your heart was functioning at about 55%. is that what they said?\n[patient] yeah, that\'s what they said.\n[doctor] okay. and did they say what was causing that?\n[patient] they said it was because of the fluid in my heart.\n[doctor] okay. and they said that you had some fluid in your heart?\n[patient] yeah, they said i had some fluid in my heart.\n[doctor] okay. and was that causing the heart failure?\n[patient] yeah, that was causing the heart failure.\n[doctor] okay. so, they were able to treat that?\n[patient] yeah, they were able to treat it.\n[doctor] okay. and are you still having any symptoms?\n[patient] yeah, i\'m still having some symptoms.\n[doctor] okay. what kind of symptoms?\n[patient] my ankles are still swollen.\n[doctor] okay. and are you having any chest pain?\n[patient] no, i\'m not having any chest pain.\n[doctor] okay. and are you having any shortness of breath?\n[patient] no, i\'m not having any shortness of breath.\n[doctor] okay. and are you having any other symptoms?\n[patient] no, i\'m just having some swelling in my ankles.\n[doctor] okay. so, what do you think caused this heart failure?\n[patient] i think it was because i was eating too much salt and my blood pressure was high.\n[doctor] okay. so, you think that was the cause?\n[patient] yeah, i think so.\n[doctor] okay. well, let\'s talk a little bit about your diet. have you been eating a lot of salty foods?\n[patient] yeah, i have been eating a lot of salty foods.\n[doctor] okay. and how much salt are you eating?\n[patient] i\'m not sure.\n[doctor] okay. do you have any idea?\n[patie